{"verdicts":[{"item":1,"status":"resolved","note":"Per-choice server-index maps route known continuation indices to the correct normalized calls; only unseen indices use the recent-call fallback, and the interleaved test covers alternating parallel continuations."},{"item":2,"status":"resolved","note":"Buffered SSE state is capped at 4 MiB, after which normalization stops and subsequent data passes through; the oversized-line test verifies preservation and fail-open behavior."},{"item":3,"status":"resolved","note":"Repo-root discovery now applies only to introspection probes lacking projectDir; sandbox probes bypass it, explicit projectDir is used unchanged, and the error references RunnerOptions.projectDir instead of a nonexistent CLI flag."}],"new_P0_P1":[]}
